# BTC/USD Algorithmic Trading Application - Phase 1 Plan

## Overview
New algorithmic trading application with simulated (mock) execution engine first, then live exchange/WebSocket, databases, and USDT/Lightning integrations behind clean interfaces.

## Technical & Quality Requirements
- **Language & Runtime**: TypeScript 5.x on Node.js 20 LTS, strict TypeScript enabled, clean modular architecture with explicit interfaces
- **Containerization**: Multi-stage Dockerfile and docker-compose.yml for reliable build/run in Docker
- **Unit testing**: Cover all core modules (domain models, balance/fee/slippage accounting, SimulatedBroker, replay engine, strategy logic, metrics calculation)
- **Integration testing**: Wire real components end-to-end (historical bars → replay feed + strategy + SimulatedBroker → balances, fills, ledger, metrics)
- **Phase 1 Scope**: Build vertical slice first

